endobj

282 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 75 0 R/T(Ensure you eat foods in appropriate portions to maintain a healthy weight and obtain all necessary nutrients. Avoid excessive consumption of any single food or nutrient, and aim for a diet that includes a mix of macronutrients\204carbohydrates, proteins, and fats.)/E(Ensure you eat foods in appropriate portions to maintain a healthy weight and obtain all necessary nutrients. Avoid excessive consumption of any single food or nutrient, and aim for a diet that includes a mix of macronutrients\204carbohydrates, proteins, and fats.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

