<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 75 0 R/T(MINDFUL EATING)/E(MINDFUL EATING)/Pg 18 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

284 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 75 0 R/T(Pay attention to what and how much you eat, savoring each bite and recognizing hunger and fullness cues. Mindful eating helps prevent overeating and promotes a healthier relationship with food by encouraging you to focus on the experience of eating and listening to your body's signals.)/E(Pay attention to what and how much you eat, savoring each bite and recognizing hunger and fullness cues. Mindful eating helps prevent overeating and promotes a healthier relationship with food by encouraging you to focus on the experience of eating and listening to your body's signals.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[6]>>
