<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 76 0 R/T(essential nutrients for overall health. Lean meats and poultry are rich sources of complete proteins, iron, and zinc, vital for muscle repair, immune function, and metabolism. Dairy products like milk and yogurt offer calcium and vitamin D, crucial for bone health and reducing osteoporosis risk. Seafood, such as fish and shellfish, supplies high-quality protein, omega-3 fatty acids, and minerals like iodine and selenium. Omega-3s support heart health and brain function, while selenium aids antioxidant defense and thyroid function. )/E(essential nutrients for overall health. Lean meats and poultry are rich sources of complete proteins, iron, and zinc, vital for muscle repair, immune function, and metabolism. Dairy products like milk and yogurt offer calcium and vitamin D, crucial for bone health and reducing osteoporosis risk. Seafood, such as fish and shellfish, supplies high-quality protein, omega-3 fatty acids, and minerals like iodine and selenium. Omega-3s support heart health and brain function, while selenium aids antioxidant defense and thyroid function. )/Pg 19 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

